  concept: "Authored objective: Charge and commission the flywheel.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the level\u2019s
    verified run history. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Capacitor voltage and current vary with circuit state; transient observations
    need a stated time and reference.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can
    establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: A storage tank illustrates temporary storage, but electrical capacitance
    has precise circuit equations.
